  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/garywill/treesandbox/zipball/v0.1.5",
  "body": "- Seamless GUI via Xpra now supports GPU render (`uc.gui='xpra-weston-xwayland'`). Xpra version requires >= 6 now\r\n- User font cache is overlayfs now. Lowerdir is host's user font cache\r\n- Session dbus supports running a isolated standalone daemon (`uc.dbus_session='isolated' `)\r\n\r\nThis is the last release that uses single-file `treesandbox.py`. In the future, code will be splited into multiple `.py` files. Deployed specific sandboxes will be single-file `.pyz` executable file (zipped .py files)"
 },
