  "body": "- Fix some error 'no /var/lib/ca-certificates'\r\n- `/var/lib/dbus/machine-id` is symlink to `/etc/machine-id`. Don't bind mount `/var/lib/dbus` anymore\r\n- Fix `gen_layerX()` uses not-ready variable `instance_name`. Replace with `sandbox_name`\r\n- icewm uses `icewm-session` command\r\n- create our `Xwrapper.config` to bind mount if needed\r\n- use function `getenv()`\r\n- other fixes and minior changes"
