  "body": "- Rename  `uc.setenvs` to `uc.set_envs` (breaking change)\r\n- A batch deploy tool to help user get their sandboxes ready\r\n- Add `--workdir` and `--workdir-try` option for cli\r\n- Fix potential multiple buffering bug by flushing stdout\r\n- Ignore error if print() gets error\r\n- EnhancedFalse will show more detailed message on error\r\n- Make symlink in outest_sbxdir to link to outest process status file"
